  fileNameEn: incident_report_04.txt
  fileNamePt: relatorio_incidente_04.txt
  titleEn: Incident report
  titlePt: "Relat\xF3rio de incidente"
  bodyEn: 'INCIDENT REPORT 04 - CONTAINMENT


    Hostile entities confirmed inside
    the facility. They do not respond to the lights.

    The subject defended herself
    under the operator''s guidance.

    Recommendation: keep the operator at the
    terminal at all times.

    Note: the entities seem to move toward the cameras
    that are switched on. Unconfirmed.'
  bodyPt: "RELAT\xD3RIO DE INCIDENTE 04 - CONTEN\xC7\xC3O\n\nEntidades hostis confirmadas
    dentro das instala\xE7\xF5es. Elas n\xE3o reagem \xE0s luzes.\nA pessoa monitorada
    se defendeu com a orienta\xE7\xE3o do operador.\nRecomenda\xE7\xE3o: manter o
    operador no terminal o tempo todo.\nObserva\xE7\xE3o: as entidades parecem ir
    na dire\xE7\xE3o das c\xE2meras ligadas. N\xE3o confirmado."
  requiredFlag: first_kill
  order: 40
